The Providence is the strider built at [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]], a platform on eight legs with buildings set on top, still ringed with scaffolding when the guests of the pilgrimage arrived. The leader of the pilgrimage named it when he addressed the crowd, and said that he and some of his Istrian companions were building it to carry pilgrims to the Void Side Wall.

The strider is large enough to hold a whole town on its back: several buildings stand on top of it, alongside strange metal domes and what looks like a turbine, with steam and smoke rising from different parts of it. Building one took a great deal of resources.
